        (source "pcb-e1-dock.kicad_sch")
        (comment (number "1") (value "Phase E17 schematic (MESHSAT-830, appendix 32.55 to 32.57), generated by tools/gen_sch_e.py. Netlist style: every pin carries a stub and a net label."))
        (comment (number "2") (value "E6: BB-2590/U cable entry and 25 A blade to the raised block; vehicle input 9-36 V through LM74700, LM5069 hot-swap and the SRF1260 filter to the raw bus up the dock contacts; LT8705A panel tracker ORed into the bus; RP2040 sensor controller on USB (BME688, BMI270, water electrodes, fans, pack SMBus, Geiger, DCF77, lightning and pod headers); eleven float clamps."))
